{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 34, :comments ["<b>And the field</b> — twice in the Masorah; one is this, and the other is ושדי תרומות, which is what we say in Arakhin: 'ושדה מגרש עריהם לא ימכר' — meaning, it shall not be changed. And likewise שדי תרומות shall not be changed, as written: אל טל ואל מטר."], :book "leviticus", :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :zh-Hans, :chapter 25, :timestamp "2026-07-27T13:55:18.591739013Z", :translated-from :en, :model "glm-5.2"}